Warmaster Revolution List Builder
=================================

Credit
------
This project was initially based on dsusco/wm-selector
(https://github.com/dsusco/wm-selector), the original open-source Warmaster
army selector. Thanks to its author and contributors for the army data and the
validation logic that this rebuild started from.

Icons
-----
The faction emblems come from game-icons.net (https://game-icons.net) by Lorc,
Delapouite and Kier Heyl, licensed under CC BY 3.0
(https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/). The background square was
removed and some emblems are mirrored. The interface icons are Font Awesome
Free (https://fontawesome.com), licensed under CC BY 4.0
(https://fontawesome.com/license/free).

Fonts
-----
The interface fonts (Big Noodle Titling, Barlow and JetBrains Mono) are
self-hosted through @cckarchev/shared, which carries their notices. The print
sheet's legible font, Atkinson Hyperlegible Next in src/theme/fonts/, is
licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org),
with its license file next to it.

